ntdll: opt-in Age of Empires IV software faults and generated-code cache on Rosetta

Wine changes recovered from Marc Ibrahim's LGPL sources via NerRobDog/wine-aoe4
711c6fc7559a565c417aab4d52d84b09767a9c1d; relocator extensions by NerRobDog.
Layout validation and ring discovery are LGPL-2.1-or-later. HDE notices retained.

HB_AOE4=1 enables the path only for RelicCardinal.exe with a verified x64 image
under Rosetta on macOS 26 or newer. AOE4_SIDECAR_PATH names the separately
installed helper; measured profiles are built into ntdll.
The same-descriptor check verifies the image being mapped. The cache uses a
SHA-bound profile or validated ring discovery; relocated fragments retain
their original addresses for exception reporting.

The instruction cache includes VM-generation-validated page snapshots and a
private no-fault copy that preserves guard pages.

